## {{ng|Denoting 'as much', 'no less'.}}
##: {{ux|en|She said we waited for three hours, but I'm sure it wasn't '''that''' long.}}
##: {{ux|en|It didn't seem like ten miles, but actually it ''was'' '''that''' far.}}
# {{lb|en|degree|in negative constructions}} To a great [[extent]] or [[degree]]; very, [[particularly]].
