#: {{ux|en|I was seen quite quickly — I didn't have to wait '''that''' long.}}
#: {{ux|en|I did the run last year, and it wasn't '''that''' difficult.}}
# {{lb|en|informal|Britain|Australia|in positive constructions}} To such an extent; [[so]].
#: {{ux|en|Ooh, I was '''that''' happy I nearly kissed her.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1693|author=w:John Hacket|chapter=Scrinia reserata: a Memorial offered to the great Deservings of John Williams|title=Archbishop Williams
|passage=This was carried with '''that''' little noise that for a good space the vigilant Bishop was not awak'd with it.}}

